<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee strengthens on dollar and pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee strengthens on dollar and pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee strengthened against both the dollar and pound on Thursday, forex dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was fixed at a mean commercial rate of 20.2965 against the dollar from 20.3265 on Wednesday. On the pound, the rupee firmed to a mean of 31.8115 from 31.8715 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--Port Louis ++230 212-6870</p>
</text>
